## Quick Start

```python
from dpie import DarkPatternEngine

# Initialize engine
engine = DarkPatternEngine(mode="deep")

# Analyze a webpage
result = engine.analyze({
    "url": "https://example.com",
    "elements": [
        {"element_type": "button", "element_text": "Subscribe now!", "element_selector": ".cta"}
    ]
})

# Print results
print("Detected patterns:", [f.detected_pattern for f in result.findings])
print("Confidence:", result.aggregated_confidence)
print("Risk:", result.aggregated_risk)

# Or use the SDK directly
from dpie import set_api_key, DarkPatternEngine
set_api_key("openai", "sk-...")
engine = DarkPatternEngine(provider="openai")
```

